| --- | --- |
| Host / stack / chrome / nav demo | `documentations/overview.md` |
| Scope slice (in/out) | `context/scope.md` |
| Product model / Care vs Ops | `context/product.md` |
| FE/BE / subdomain architecture | `context/architecture.md` |
